  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency agricultural livelihoods support to the most vulnerable agriculture- and fisheries-depende</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to the prevention of famine and mitigation of hunger by enhancing food security of vulnerable families in six districts of four governorates at high risk of famine including : Al Khawkhah, Milhan, Al Qubbaytah, Tur Al Bahah, Al Madaribah Wa Al Arah, and Hayfan Districts. Project design has considered the specific needs of each gender and various age groups by recognizing the different roles that women, girls, men and boys have in their productive activities.</narrative>
  </description>
